hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1503","Yunus bin Abdul-Ala told us, Ibn Wahb told us, Ibn Abi Dhib told us, on the authority of Sa’id bin Abi Sa’id al-Maqbari, on the authority of Sa’id Ibn Yasar, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, on the authority of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “A man does not visit mosques for prayer unless God rejoices over him.” When he leaves his house, just as the family of an absent person would embrace their absent person when he comes to them.”"
